                    </a>
                    <button type="button" class="ghost-link" id="seeItInActionBtn">
                        Watch the 2-Minute Fix
                    </button>
                </div>
                <p class="hero-note">Free 30-minute discovery call. No obligation.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- PAIN AMPLIFICATION -->
        <section class="pain-section" aria-labelledby="pain-heading">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-header reveal">
                    <h2 id="pain-heading">It is not your product. It is your page.</h2>
                    <p>Most digital product sellers blame their offer when their page is the real problem. Here is what a bad page is actually costing you.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pain-grid">
                    <div class="pain-card reveal">
                        <div class="pain-number">119X</div>
                        <h3 class="pain-label">Slow</h3>
                        <p class="pain-desc">The average landing page weighs 2.86MB. This template is 24kb. That is 119 times lighter. Every extra kilobyte costs you Google rankings, page speed, and the split second patience of a buyer who almost clicked.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pain-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
                        <div class="pain-number">$2.5K</div>
                        <h3 class="pain-label">Expensive</h3>
                        <p class="pain-desc">At $197 a month that is what you spend on a funnel builder in a year. Not on ads. Not on your product. On a subscription to someone else's platform. A platform you cannot take with you when you leave.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pain-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
